addQ(D,"What should you verify before provisioning a discovered node?","Correct software image and node category","Only the GPU fan RPM","The user\u2019s notebook theme","Job completion time","Image and category settings must be valid.");
addQ(D,"What is the purpose of a BCM software image?","Define the operating environment deployed to nodes","Set the Slurm job priority","Measure NVLink bandwidth","Store container stdout","Images determine deployed node software.");
addQ(D,"What action persists staged changes in BCM cmsh?","commit","squeue","kubectl logs","nvidia-smi","BCM configuration edits are committed.");
addQ(D,"What should follow a BCM image update?","Validate synchronization and node health","Immediately delete all jobs","Disable monitoring","Assume all nodes are healthy","Always verify deployment state.");
addQ(D,"Which BCM interface provides graphical cluster monitoring?","Base View","sacct","kubelet","docker build","Base View is a BCM management UI.");
addQ(D,"When installing Kubernetes through BCM, what matters first?","Healthy nodes and appropriate host configuration","Only a Docker Hub account","A Slurm pending job","Removing DNS","Healthy underlying nodes are prerequisites.");
addQ(D,"Why configure management networking separately?","Provide reliable provisioning and out-of-band access","Increase GPU clock rate","Avoid needing node images","Replace storage networking","Management access enables node control and troubleshooting.");
addQ(D,"What does an NGC container image reference identify?","A container repository, image, and tag","A GPU serial number","A Slurm partition","A power distribution unit","Container image references select the artifact to pull.");
addQ(D,"What is an important consideration when updating firmware?","Compatibility and a validated maintenance plan","Skipping rollback planning","Changing unrelated partitions","Disabling all logs","Firmware updates need compatibility checks and planned verification.");
