addQ(A,"What does a Slurm partition represent?","A logical grouping of compute resources","A physical disk partition only","A Kubernetes container image","A DPU firmware slot","Partitions organize scheduling access.");
addQ(A,"Why monitor cluster service health?","Detect failures before workload impact","Increase tensor precision","Remove the need for logs","Guarantee no maintenance","Service monitoring helps preserve availability.");
