addQ(W,"What is an NGC container used for?","Packaging an application and its runtime dependencies","Changing switch cabling","Updating a UPS","Replacing BCM","NGC provides containerized software.");
addQ(W,"What does ImagePullBackOff typically mean?","Kubernetes cannot retrieve the specified image","The GPU is too cold","Slurm is offline","The node has been provisioned","Image retrieval problems cause ImagePullBackOff.");
