addQ(W,"Why request nvidia.com/gpu in a pod specification?","Reserve advertised GPU resources for the workload","Set the GPU serial number","Change a Slurm partition","Disable the GPU Operator","GPU resources are scheduled through Kubernetes resource requests.");
addQ(W,"What can prevent a GPU pod from scheduling?","No allocatable GPUs on eligible nodes","A healthy matching node with free GPUs","Successful container startup","A completed Slurm job","GPU capacity and scheduling constraints matter.");
