addQ(W,"What is a toleration used for?","Allow pods to schedule despite matching taints","Provide GPU drivers","Drain Slurm nodes","Create a BCM category","Tolerations match taint rules.");
addQ(W,"Why set workload resource limits?","Control consumption and protect shared capacity","Guarantee a faster GPU","Remove monitoring","Make all jobs run instantly","Limits constrain resource usage.");
