addQ(W,"Why verify workload placement after deployment?","Confirm the intended node and GPU allocation","Change the model dataset","Replace storage hardware","Ignore pod status","Placement validation catches scheduling issues.");
addQ(W,"What is the difference between training and inference workloads?","Training updates model parameters; inference uses a model to predict","Both always require identical resources","Inference always changes model weights","Training never uses GPUs","Their execution patterns and resource needs differ.");
