addQ(T,"What does journalctl -u slurmd provide?","Recent logs for the Slurm daemon","Only GPU utilization","Container image layers","Kubernetes taints","Service logs aid diagnosis.");
addQ(T,"What is a likely cause of GPU GRES mismatch?","Slurm resource configuration differs from detected GPUs","A healthy matching resource inventory","A successful container pull","An available storage mount","Compare Slurm GRES and physical inventory.");
addQ(T,"Why check the NVIDIA device plugin?","Kubernetes relies on it to advertise GPUs","It replaces kubelet","It provisions BCM images","It updates Slurm partitions","Device plugins expose GPU resources.");
addQ(T,"What is a common cause of container image pull failure?","Incorrect tag, credentials, or registry connectivity","An idle Slurm node","A committed BCM category","A completed training job","Check registry access and image references.");
