addQ(T,"What does DCGM help monitor?","GPU telemetry, health, and diagnostics","Only Slurm usernames","Only BCM image commits","Only IP address leases","DCGM is NVIDIA GPU management telemetry tooling.");
addQ(T,"What should be checked during storage performance diagnosis?","Latency, throughput, errors, and workload access pattern","Only disk color","Only pod labels","Only job names","Storage bottlenecks require measured evidence.");
addQ(T,"Why compare before-and-after metrics during optimization?","Validate that a change improved the intended outcome","Avoid recording changes","Prove all faults are fixed forever","Disable alerts","Measured validation prevents guesswork.");
